    "削除" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Delete" } } } },
    "参照名はモデル設定の apiKeyEnv と合わせます。保存済みのキーはアプリへ返されません。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Match the reference to apiKeyEnv in the model settings. Saved keys are never returned to the app." } } } },
