    "変更が必要な操作では、許可を確認します。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Asks for approval before any operation that makes changes." } } } },
    "外出中もDGXのAIと話せる？" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Can I talk to my DGX AI while I’m away?" } } } },
    "外出先ではiPhoneのTailscaleが接続中か確認してください。下書きと端末登録は引き続き使えます。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "When you are away, make sure Tailscale is connected on your iPhone. Drafts and device registration remain available." } } } },
    "外出先ではiPhoneのTailscaleをオンにしてください。登録コードはDGX側で発行し、10分間・1回のみ有効です。" : { "localizations" : { "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Turn on Tailscale on your iPhone when you are away. Pairing codes are generated on your DGX and work once for 10 minutes." } } } },
